+          <div>
+            <span className="eyebrow">Free · in your browser · alpha</span>
+            <h1>Film tools.</h1>
+            <p>Small single-purpose tools for the work around the edit: caption it, board it, grade it. Each one runs locally and hands its result to the ScenePilot editor.</p>
